Add to README_WiB.md:
```markdown
## CRITICAL: FILE ACCESS PROTOCOL

**ABSOLUTE REQUIREMENT:**
Use ONLY Filesystem MCP Server tools. Never use native file tools.

**Mandatory Tools:**
✅ Filesystem:read_text_file     (read files)
✅ Filesystem:write_file         (create/overwrite files)
✅ Filesystem:list_directory     (list contents)
✅ Filesystem:directory_tree     (recursive structure)

❌ NEVER: view, read_file, create_file, bash_tool for file reading

**Path Resolution:**
- Use tilde for user paths: ~/weitergehts-workspace/
- Filesystem MCP auto-resolves ~/ to user home
- Cross-platform compatible
```

