Markdown Elements → Word Equivalent:
- `# Heading` → Formatted heading (bold, larger font)
- `## Subheading` → Formatted subheading
- `**bold**` → Bold formatting
- `- list item` → Bullet point
- `| table |` → Word table (complex!)
- Plain text → Plain text

**WORKFLOW:**
1. Parse Markdown line by line
2. Detect element type (heading, list, table, text)
3. Apply appropriate Word formatting
4. Insert into Word document
